      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "The new OR branch `retryCount: { gt: 1 }` removes any reminder with retryCount 2 or more, regardless of its scheduledDate or whether it is still a valid unsent reminder. Since the code later increments `retryCount` on each failed scheduling attempt, a reminder can be permanently deleted after the second retry even if it has not yet expired, which changes the retry semantics from 'retry' to 'discard after two tries'.",
